OL,3,AFirst Children's Booker prize reveals
OL,4,Ashortlist - and its child judges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ever Children's Booker Prize
OL,7,Fhas announced the eight books in the
OL,8,Frunning for the new #50,000 award.
OL,10,FFive novels, two graphic novels and an
OL,11,Fillustrated collection of short stories
OL,12,Fare on the shortlist, which is aimed at
OL,13,Fchildren aged eight to 12. The authors
OL,14,Fin contention include former Children's
OL,15,FLaureate of Ireland Eoin Colfer, who is
OL,16,Fbest known for his Artemis Fowl series,
OL,17,Fand teacher and children's author
OL,18,FCatherine Bruton.
OL,20,FFour children have also been announced
OL,21,Fas new judges after a UK-wide
OL,22,Fcompetition.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
